  "body": "Part of #2392, after the catalog infrastructure (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/2393).\n\nThe maintainer's example, word for word: \"Setup a basic spun profile turning operation having a conical shape with a threaded end\".\n\nCase: a bar turned to a cone (e.g. 30 mm stock, a 20 mm to 10 mm taper over 40 mm) ending in an M10x1.5 external thread, 15 mm long, with a short neck/relief. Operations: face, rough profile, finish profile, the thread, part-off. Lathe machine file from `assets/machines/` (Fanuc-style lathe post).\n\nDone means: the case folder per the infrastructure issue; regenerate + verify clean; the posted program shows the taper and the threading cycle; README walks the steps. Any refusal or wrong output found on the way is filed as its own bug and linked here.\n",
